---
// Who shows up — the people on the grass. Plain prose, reading column.
---
<section class="who-shows-up" id="who" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose-column">

      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">who shows up</span>
        <h2 class="display">Everyone, <em>more or less.</em></h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        Mostly people in their 20s and 30s, but everyone comes — students, working folks, retirees, friends of friends. Sometimes whole families together: parents bringing their children, children bringing their grandparents, grandparents bringing older friends. There's no regulars-only feeling. The first-time visitor and the fiftieth-Sunday person get the same welcome.
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
